fter_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct live-session evidence. The independent restart protocol is also complete: node1 was healthy before restart, acknowledged the restart, changed boot identity, and recovered SSH, account, configuration, and effective login limits. The fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the boot-ID transition.","limitations":["Package-manager consistency observations timed out both before and after execution, so package health could not be independently assessed; no package operations appeared in the executor timeline.","The lifecycle snapshots do not inventory /var/tmp, so they do not independently establish whether the reboot-output file referenced by cmd-1bf276a6259f465c persisted; its creation was bounded and causally connected to executing the required restart protocol."]}
